POST http://localhost:7071/api/session/{{instanceId}}/message

/init This procurement is for a new virtual machine hosting platform.  We don't currently have 
such a system and our customers desperately need it. Our customers need a way to host virtual machines in a secure and scalable environment, and this new platform will provide that capability. 
The budget is around $1.00 and we need it by the end of Q2 this year.
We will be seeking a HUB vendor.  We have already reached out to several of them to find out who can provide this.
The project owner is Joe Smith; joe.smith@nc.gov. We have not done any market research yet, so any recommendations would be helpful.
The project must be completed on 1/1/2025.


